        <mxCell id="char-text" value="&lt;b&gt;Strengths:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Fully AWS-native (no Snowflake)&lt;br&gt;• Unified storage (time-series + events)&lt;br&gt;• Native partition-based multi-tenancy&lt;br&gt;• Grafana white-label dashboards&lt;br&gt;• Real-time latency (&amp;lt;5s)&lt;br&gt;• Cost-effective ($132/tenant)&lt;br&gt;• Auto-scaling (no tuning)&lt;br&gt;• Simpler than Flink option&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Considerations:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Timestream SQL differs from standard&lt;br&gt;• Grafana adds external dependency&lt;br&gt;• More complex than Snowflake option&lt;br&gt;• Medium operational overhead&lt;br&gt;• 22-week timeline&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cost&lt;/b&gt;: $3,965/month (30 tenants)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Team&lt;/b&gt;: 2-3 engineers (AWS-native)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Timeline&lt;/b&gt;: 22 weeks&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Best for:&lt;/b&gt; AWS-native mandate" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
